and its bare `lint DESIGN.md` path is replaced there with the repository-root path.

Why vendored rather than installed: upstream ships no marketplace or plugin manifest, so
it installed only through the `ui-skills` entry in this catalog. That entry tracks
unpinned `main` and brings six more skills that nothing here routes to. One pinned file
removes the install step from `design-md`.
